{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1015262-stargate-the-awakening","id":1015262,"title":"Stargate the awakening?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-12-10T09:07:41-08:00","id":1015262,"title":"Stargate the awakening?","content":"So my googlefu is failing me, and in response to the other thread that huntress made about the tower that's alive, I kind of figured that the stargate universe could be adapted into going to different umbral realms instead of going to different planets. Transportation would be the same through the stargate (correspondence and what not) and the chars would start off as low end technocrats with like ar\u00eate 1 and some advanced weapons and kind of hop from realm to realm learning the spirit ways.<br /> <br /> Has this been done before and a conversion or something been made by chance, or anyone have any cool ideas of areas? I obviously wont be following the gould and such timeline I want to make my own.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1552-asssassin","name":"Asssassin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-10T19:38:40-08:00","id":1015483,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asssassin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1015262-stargate-the-awakening#post1015262\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So my googlefu is failing me, and in response to the other thread that huntress made about the tower that's alive, I kind of figured that the stargate universe could be adapted into going to different umbral realms instead of going to different planets. Transportation would be the same through the stargate (correspondence and what not) and the chars would start off as low end technocrats with like ar\u00eate 1 and some advanced weapons and kind of hop from realm to realm learning the spirit ways.<br /> <br /> Has this been done before and a conversion or something been made by chance, or anyone have any cool ideas of areas? I obviously wont be following the gould and such timeline I want to make my own.</div> </div> </div> </div>LOL. We started tossing around variants of this idea as a possible &quot;next game&quot;.... Though we are trying to make the whole idea a little more elastic and probably Tradition-concept friendly. But, basically, the conceit of &quot;the party is the team and the missions are using a widget to explore other places/dimensions/Umbral Realms&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-11T01:42:09-08:00","id":1015601,"title":"","content":"Okay. Thank you for your answers. My game was yesterday and I decided to go for a narrative description of the Seekings of my players. I will tell you some of what I said :<br /> <br /> - The Virtual Adept (a hacker): He received an e-mail without object nor sender, and with an only link towards a website with a 1 hour countdown that begun the moment he was on the site. A door oped on the screen and he clicked on it. Then he entered a complex code that he was to hack, a code with multiple security protocols sent by his Avatar. This was a metaphor of his mind and each block that he passed opened a world of possibilities, making him closer to the next level of Enlightment. In the end, he made the necessary effort and managed to pass many blocks and the Avatar granted him that next level.<br /> <br /> - The Cultist (a singer): She was preparing for a concert when the world begun to blur around her and suddenly she was on a stage in front of what she understood was the sad and giving up humanity. Fueled by the desire to help men and women let go of the fear and to give them the hope to go forward, she begun to sing, shortly followed by a man looking much like Freddy Mercury (her Avatar). Step by step, she was to guide humanity towards the state of awareness of their own abilities to help them understand that they matter and that they can do something about their lives. It was a song of hope and magick.<br /> <br /> - The Hermetic (an alchemist): In a dream, he traveled the maze of his own mind, guided by a man that looked much like him, only much older (his Avatar) through his memories. In each memory he grasped a little more of the signification of each event, unraveling the misteries of each place he went, each person he met, seeing powerful mystic threads, symbols and characters of ancient langages. He awakened with a new knowledge of how the world functions and how to make it his.<br /> <br /> - The Hollow One (a poet): His Avatar is a muse having the shape of a beatiful woman with tatoos of inspiring words and phrases that she only let him see from far, feeding his passion, his inpiration and fueling his own madness. But in this dream, she let him go closer, authorizing him to touch her. They had a carnal and sensual relation that particular night where she let him scouring her body and learn new concepts to inspire his Work on a deeper level. But she would not let him know of all her intimity, only showing certain parts of her body, thus only parts of the words and phrases she had on her. He awakened with a new look on the world.<br /> <br /> Thank you again !","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8572-nicotheduck","name":"NicoTheDuck","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-11T09:21:46-08:00","id":1015697,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NicoTheDuck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1015262-stargate-the-awakening?p=1015601#post1015601\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay. Thank you for your answers. My game was yesterday and I decided to go for a narrative description of the Seekings of my players. I will tell you some of what I said :<br /> <br /> - The Virtual Adept (a hacker): He received an e-mail without object nor sender, and with an only link towards a website with a 1 hour countdown that begun the moment he was on the site. A door oped on the screen and he clicked on it. Then he entered a complex code that he was to hack, a code with multiple security protocols sent by his Avatar. This was a metaphor of his mind and each block that he passed opened a world of possibilities, making him closer to the next level of Enlightment. In the end, he made the necessary effort and managed to pass many blocks and the Avatar granted him that next level.<br /> <br /> - The Cultist (a singer): She was preparing for a concert when the world begun to blur around her and suddenly she was on a stage in front of what she understood was the sad and giving up humanity. Fueled by the desire to help men and women let go of the fear and to give them the hope to go forward, she begun to sing, shortly followed by a man looking much like Freddy Mercury (her Avatar). Step by step, she was to guide humanity towards the state of awareness of their own abilities to help them understand that they matter and that they can do something about their lives. It was a song of hope and magick.<br /> <br /> - The Hermetic (an alchemist): In a dream, he traveled the maze of his own mind, guided by a man that looked much like him, only much older (his Avatar) through his memories. In each memory he grasped a little more of the signification of each event, unraveling the misteries of each place he went, each person he met, seeing powerful mystic threads, symbols and characters of ancient langages. He awakened with a new knowledge of how the world functions and how to make it his.<br /> <br /> - The Hollow One (a poet): His Avatar is a muse having the shape of a beatiful woman with tatoos of inspiring words and phrases that she only let him see from far, feeding his passion, his inpiration and fueling his own madness. But in this dream, she let him go closer, authorizing him to touch her. They had a carnal and sensual relation that particular night where she let him scouring her body and learn new concepts to inspire his Work on a deeper level. But she would not let him know of all her intimity, only showing certain parts of her body, thus only parts of the words and phrases she had on her. He awakened with a new look on the world.<br /> <br /> Thank you again !</div> </div> </div> </div>I think you may have wanted to post this in your thread about how to do Seekings?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-11T11:09:20-08:00","id":1015741,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ajax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1015262-stargate-the-awakening?p=1015697#post1015697\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think you may have wanted to post this in your thread about how to do Seekings?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah of course !!! I'm so sorry guys ! I'll repost this in the right post <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8572-nicotheduck","name":"NicoTheDuck","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-11T17:01:33-08:00","id":1015901,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ajax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1015262-stargate-the-awakening?p=1015483#post1015483\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> LOL. We started tossing around variants of this idea as a possible &quot;next game&quot;.... Though we are trying to make the whole idea a little more elastic and probably Tradition-concept friendly. But, basically, the conceit of &quot;the party is the team and the missions are using a widget to explore other places/dimensions/Umbral Realms&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah I was trying to figure out the best way to widget around and stargate seemed the easiest, and of course who would have said startgate, either technocracy or void engineers...so to stick with the government theme, I figured technos would be the best. Also when super science weapons and such came up then they could be explained that way (gould healing device is just life 3...etc)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1552-asssassin","name":"Asssassin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-11T17:56:16-08:00","id":1015917,"title":"","content":"The real question for such a game is, &quot;Why are you (the characters) doing it?&quot; Or, for a Technocracy game, &quot;Where's the funding coming from?&quot;<br /> <br /> In Stargate, the reason for the ludicrous expense and insane risk is because the alternative is planetary subjugation to alien gods. Presumably if the Technocracy is sending you out into extremely un-sanitized zones and risking your precious Conditioning, not to mention spending limited resources and Enlightenment, there has to be a reason.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7356-haldir2012","name":"haldir2012","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"148"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-12T00:39:19-08:00","id":1016016,"title":"","content":"What about : &quot;The end of times is coming and we need a backup solution to save mankind&quot;. The idea would be to find a place okay for humans to migrate to.<br /> You can make all that part of a project of the void engineers to save mankind. If you team never goes back to earth, I can not see the point to play in the WoD though. More adapted games exist for that (fading suns for exemple). However, you can play it with a political meta plot on earth and your exploration team is in a middle of some sort of imbroglio of different parties of the Union having different motivations for the project.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8572-nicotheduck","name":"NicoTheDuck","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-12T05:22:33-08:00","id":1016072,"title":"","content":"Alternatively, you could do like Sliders and have the group trapped somewhere in the umbra with a devise that randomly throws them into a new realm when fully charged. The only way to get home is to keep bouncing around until they get lucky and reach home, or find a better metho in the meantime.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-12T09:32:37-08:00","id":1016139,"title":"","content":"There can be as many reasons as there are chronicles that support the idea. Actually, MORE reasons than that, since each character can have a personal motivation as well. After all, in Stargate-SG1 at the start, every character had their own motivation and those motivations were more important than the government's &quot;Uh-oh! Alien space gods! Better try to find out more...&quot;<br /> <br /> Teal'c wanted restitution for his past misdeeds and to honor the people who had freed him over government motivation. <br /> Daniel wanted to find his wife and free her from being a host over government motivation<br /> Jack wanted to finish what he had started + government motivation<br /> Carter wanted to prove she was just as good (better even) than anyone else who could do the job + government motivation","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-12T10:45:10-08:00","id":1016152,"title":"","content":"Agreed, but the reason they had the secret underground base and the guns and the support staff and everything else they needed was due to government motivation. In other words - Daniel doesn't have to care about the GM's plot device of &quot;alien space gods conquering America!&quot; but without that plot device, Daniel's not going anywhere.<br /> <br /> As always the problem can be solved with GM fiat if you don't mind the inelegance. Forget the government; instead Daniel happens to find a dial-home device digging in Thailand somewhere because reasons, hooks it up in the basement of the university building where he lectures, but alien space gods jump out and grab his wife. Daniel recruits some old pals to go space-spelunking and save her, with Carhartt jackets and shotguns from Wal-Mart.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7356-haldir2012","name":"haldir2012","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"148"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-13T18:01:31-08:00","id":1016842,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>haldir2012</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1015262-stargate-the-awakening?p=1016152#post1016152\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Agreed, but the reason they had the secret underground base and the guns and the support staff and everything else they needed was due to government motivation. In other words - Daniel doesn't have to care about the GM's plot device of &quot;alien space gods conquering America!&quot; but without that plot device, Daniel's not going anywhere.<br /> <br /> As always the problem can be solved with GM fiat if you don't mind the inelegance. Forget the government; instead Daniel happens to find a dial-home device digging in Thailand somewhere because reasons, hooks it up in the basement of the university building where he lectures, but alien space gods jump out and grab his wife. Daniel recruits some old pals to go space-spelunking and save her, with Carhartt jackets and shotguns from Wal-Mart.</div> </div> </div> </div>Except anything like that would be picked up by the technocracy's stuff, but yeah its going to be a make an outpost, save humans if you find them, learn about other worldly things type crawl.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1552-asssassin","name":"Asssassin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-15T12:27:57-08:00","id":1017750,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asssassin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1015262-stargate-the-awakening?p=1016842#post1016842\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Except anything like that would be picked up by the technocracy's stuff, but yeah its going to be a make an outpost, save humans if you find them, learn about other worldly things type crawl.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not if it is sufficiently advanced technology/a.k.a. magic/ cloaking/ No Ordinary Magnitude Area Net Accumulating Regions","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>So, this Zen Master walks up to a hot dog stand and says: &quot;Make me one with everything!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12022-nonsense","name":"Nonsense","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12022_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"815"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-15T14:56:01-08:00","id":1017812,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nonsense</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1015262-stargate-the-awakening?p=1017750#post1017750\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Not if it is sufficiently advanced technology/a.k.a. magic/ cloaking/ No Ordinary Magnitude Area Net Accumulating Regions</div> </div> </div> </div>True but it has to be powered somehow. So if its selfpowered (quint essentially) or on the grid (which needs an actual grid to power it and would draw a substantial amount) they would notice. The only way away from that is handwaving from the gm. Even using spirit 4 to rip a gate into another realm (essentially what this is doing) has vulgarity and paradox written all over it.","signature":"","edited