ted","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1552-asssassin","name":"Asssassin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-18T00:05:58-08:00","id":1018719,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asssassin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1015262-stargate-the-awakening?p=1018289#post1018289\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The thing looking has no mind.... its automated</div> </div> </div> </div>I would say it matters not if the effect gets the operator or the A.I. (which has a mind).<br /> The Teechnocracy is not insane enough to give a machine the power to take action without controlling it. And the emergency protocol (if no operator responded within x minutes)is most likely an A.I.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>So, this Zen Master walks up to a hot dog stand and says: &quot;Make me one with everything!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12022-nonsense","name":"Nonsense","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12022_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"815"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-18T12:47:57-08:00","id":1018872,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nonsense</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1015262-stargate-the-awakening?p=1018719#post1018719\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I would say it matters not if the effect gets the operator or the A.I. (which has a mind).<br /> The Teechnocracy is not insane enough to give a machine the power to take action without controlling it. And the emergency protocol (if no operator responded within x minutes)is most likely an A.I.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah I guess at this point we would have to start the discussion on what makes an AI an AI. Does auto targeting by certain parameters make it an AI (ie if it is moving and has no room temperature) or does that make it have a checklist that it differentiates one from another.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1552-asssassin","name":"Asssassin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-18T13:33:10-08:00","id":1018883,"title":"","content":"How about &quot;Someone in the Union that was part of making this doo-dad had Mind 5&quot;? Or &quot;An AI is a Spirit that is created by Union science&quot;? Unless you like your Technocracy incompetent, then it's an EDE that possessed a piece of technology they created, fooling them into thinking they created intelligence&quot;?<br /> <br /> Taking this back to the source material, if there is an AI (which there doesn't really need to be, since that's not what the Stargate does, it isn't the TARDIS;t's a machine that operates in response to a built-in control set-up - it doesn't make decisions about where it goes), it can be ANY sort of AI, since it's a found object that the Union is exploiting that was made by someone or something else.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-18T17:30:01-08:00","id":1018977,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ajax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1015262-stargate-the-awakening?p=1018883#post1018883\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How about &quot;Someone in the Union that was part of making this doo-dad had Mind 5&quot;? Or &quot;An AI is a Spirit that is created by Union science&quot;? Unless you like your Technocracy incompetent, then it's an EDE that possessed a piece of technology they created, fooling them into thinking they created intelligence&quot;?<br /> <br /> Taking this back to the source material, if there is an AI (which there doesn't really need to be, since that's not what the Stargate does, it isn't the TARDIS;t's a machine that operates in response to a built-in control set-up - it doesn't make decisions about where it goes), it can be ANY sort of AI, since it's a found object that the Union is exploiting that was made by someone or something else.</div> </div> </div> </div>The question about AI wasn't from if the device had one (we were assuming it wasn't sentient) it was if and when it is used would the government/technocracy be able to detect it. And he(she? sorry?) pointed out that a mind 2 entropy 2 effect could essentially cloak it and I said that if the thing searching for spikes in quintessence or huge power surges wasn't actually a person and was a machine...then mind would or wouldn't work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1552-asssassin","name":"Asssassin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}